Peter,

I&rsquo;m out on the campaign trail every day, and one thing is crystal clear.

The good people of our district desperately want to have a voice in Washington. They want Washington to understand how their reckless spending sprees are crippling families, and they want Washington to do something about it.

I stepped down from the bench to run for Congress because I want to be a voice for the great people of IL-17. I&rsquo;m out there everyday fighting for our district, and I&rsquo;m not stopping.

But with just days left until voters start casting their ballots and my race neck-and-neck, I need your help.
