Whether they&rsquo;re blue collar, whether they&rsquo;re working in manufacturing, whether they&rsquo;re entrepreneurs, whether they&rsquo;re farmers, people tell me that they just can&rsquo;t keep up with the inflation. They can&rsquo;t keep up with the high interest rates, and all that&rsquo;s happened during the Biden-Harris administration.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=e9239814cdf60cb05a164e025212c48dda120822addd5b651124f845e1899ebc95bee448f9d7f4f21806c57e602ca7f375d3e3849eba36766fbc464c06154340

They don&rsquo;t know how they&rsquo;re going to make it. They don&rsquo;t know how they&rsquo;re going to hold onto the American Dream.

They don&rsquo;t know how their children and grandchildren are going to be able to experience the same kind of life they&rsquo;ve been able to experience.

And it&rsquo;s all because of reckless federal spending we don&rsquo;t even have. It&rsquo;s because of bureaucrats in Washington putting themselves and politics first.

I get asked all of the time when we are going to finally start putting Americans first.

I&rsquo;m committed to putting the people first&mdash;to know them, to know their needs, and to be their stalwart voice in Congress.

That&rsquo;s what I&rsquo;m doing every day on the campaign trail, and it&rsquo;s why with just a few days left until the first votes are cast in my election, I need your help.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=e9239814cdf60cb05a164e025212c48dda120822addd5b651124f845e1899ebc95bee448f9d7f4f21806c57e602ca7f375d3e3849eba36766fbc464c06154340
